/> <br /> Life 5, metamorphosise other, (duck into cat)<br /> <br /> either Prime 4, Matter 4 (make the cauldron out of nothing),<br /> or Matter 1, Correspondence 2 apportation (teleport the caldron to you)<br /> <br /> Time 3, Time Warp (reverse time to fix the vase)<br /> <br /> Spirit 2, Touch spirit (hit spirit with broom)<br /> or Prime 2, enchant weapon (make the broom able to hit the spirit)<br /> <br /> Life 5, metamorphosise other, (frog to wolf)<br /> <br /> Spirit 5, Transform Spirit (turning the alien, which in my mind counts as a spirit, into the shape of a frog)<br /> <br /> <br /> I spent far too much time on this...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":12193,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","user":"Saikou","date":". 03-18-2018, 10:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T19:24:46-07:00","id":1197005,"title":"","content":"Sorry, I'm going to play the rules lawyer. Forgive me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1196965-which-spheres-rotes-are-shown-in-this-video?p=1196992#post1196992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">either Prime 4, Matter 4 (make the cauldron out of nothing),<br /> or Matter 1, Correspondence 2 apportation (teleport the caldron to you)</div> </div> </div> </div>You do not require Prime to match the Sphere rating of Matter, if you're creating something ex nihilo. That's just a Correspondence thing. While we're at it, Matter 4 is needed for creating mechanically complex objects, like machines. A cauldron, being a shaped lump of metal with no internal complexity, would only require Matter 3.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, transporting objects with Correspondence doesn't require Matter, unless you're transporting a part of a larger pattern. If the cauldron is the whole object, only Correspondence is needed. Depending on whether the cauldron is larger than, say, a house cat (I haven't seen the video, because reasons), it might require Correspondence 3 instead of 2.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Spirit 2, Touch spirit (hit spirit with broom)<br /> or Prime 2, enchant weapon (make the broom able to hit the spirit) </div> </div> </div>Spirit 2 allows the person themselves to touch (or punch) a spirit, but having an object do it requires either Spirit 2 + Matter 2, or Spirit 3.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T19:56:49-07:00","id":1197014,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I'm surprised I only got two of these wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}